# agent-home shared environment — one place for the secrets and env vars your
# MCP servers and model providers need, sourced by every shell (the installer
# adds one line to ~/.zshenv), so the same server works in every harness.
#
# KEY=value lines only. Lives at ~/.agent-home/env — never commit it anywhere.
#
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# SNOWFLAKE_PASSWORD=
